roxml provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-roxml CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::roxml::roxml)

The C API is available as <roxml.h>; the library is named libroxml (-lroxml).
The imported target links the shared or static library according to the
VCPKG_LIBRARY_LINKAGE triplet setting. On Windows the DLL is in bin/.
The roxml XPath shell utility is installed to bin/roxml.

Pkg-config is also supported:

    pkg_check_modules(LIBROXML REQUIRED IMPORTED_TARGET libroxml)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE PkgConfig::LIBROXML)
